{"suttaId":"tha-ap456","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1147,1161],"vripara":"22"},"segments":{"tha-ap456:0.3":"Tiṇukkadhāriyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap456:1.1":"“Padumuttarabuddhassa, bodhiyā pādaputtame;","tha-ap456:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, tayo ukke adhārayiṃ.","tha-ap456:2.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, sohaṃ ukkamadhārayiṃ;","tha-ap456:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ukkadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap456:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap456:4.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap456:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap456:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tiṇukkadhāriyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap456:7.1":"Tiṇukkadhāriyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
